# Borrowed assets, development only.
#
# These are streamed models copied from another resource so the hose has something in hand
# while our own is modelled. They are deliberately **not** in the repository: a clone gets the
# code and none of somebody else's art, which means the question of shipping them cannot come
# up by accident.
#
# The resource works without them -- the prop simply does not load and the hose still runs.
# See ASSET-001 in docs/internal/TASKS.md.
stream/w_am_hose.*
stream/rope.ytd
